{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros\/Event(name:consent:version:)"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"name"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentCategory","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"version"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"roleHeading":"Macro","title":"Event(name:consent:version:)","externalID":"s:11EventMacros0A04name7consent7versionySSSg_6Events15ConsentCategoryVSgSitcfm","symbolKind":"macro","modules":[{"name":"EventMacros"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Event.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/EventMacros\/Event.swift#L107"}},"abstract":[{"text":"Makes a struct an event: derives its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryCodable"},{"text":" conformances, its name and its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" from its declaration.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@attached","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"(extension, conformances: ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events5EventP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BinaryCodable","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/BinaryCodable","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence13BinaryCodableP"},{"text":", names: named(name), named(consentCategory), named(schemaVersion), named(schema), named(constraintViolation), named(encode(to:)), named(init(from:)), named(requireBinaryCodable), named(binaryCodableRequirements)) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"macro","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentCategory","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"version","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" = 1)","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The name destinations record the event under, a string literal; the type’s name when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"name":"name"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The purpose the event is collected for; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory\/analytics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"consent"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The schema version, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event.schemaVersion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": a positive integer literal, raised for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each breaking change; 1 by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"version"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import EventMacros","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\", consent: .functional, version: 2)","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","    var seats: Int?","    var email: Sensitive<String>","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The macro adds an extension holding:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"static var name","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", when "},{"code":"name","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is given; otherwise the type’s name, "},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static var consentCategory"},{"text":", when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"consent"},{"text":" is given; otherwise ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory\/analytics","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static var schemaVersion"},{"type":"text","text":", when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":" is given; otherwise 1, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":"’s default."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"static var schema","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" with the event’s name, version and each stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property’s name, type as written, optionality, whether it has a default value and validation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keywords (its "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refined","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" type’s rule’s, then those "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros\/Constrained(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" declares), in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declaration order."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"constraintViolation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", when a property declares constraints with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros\/Constrained(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first property, in declaration order, whose value breaks one, which a tracker rejects.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"encode(to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"init(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which write a CBOR map of the stored properties, each under","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its name, in declaration order, and read each back by its name, as a hand-written conformance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would. An optional property missing from the map reads as ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and one with a default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value as that value. A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" property goes through its own conformance, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only a store’s encoder writes its value.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every stored instance property is encoded, and needs a type annotation. Static and computed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties are left out, and so is a ","type":"text"},{"code":"let","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with an initial value, which every value shares.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The struct keeps its memberwise initializer.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A stored property whose type isn’t "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryCodable"},{"type":"text","text":" is a compile error naming it:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static method 'requireBinaryCodable(bad:)' requires that 'Foo' conform to 'BinaryCodable'"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a property "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bad"},{"type":"text","text":" of type "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Foo"},{"type":"text","text":". Applying the macro to anything but a struct, a property with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type annotation, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lazy"},{"type":"text","text":" property, a destructuring pattern, a name that isn’t a non-empty string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"literal and a version that isn’t a positive integer literal are compile errors too."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Changing-an-event","level":2,"text":"Changing an event"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A store may still hold records written before an event’s stored properties changed: an app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"updates with records on disk it hasn’t delivered. ","type":"text"},{"code":"version","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" counts the changes those records","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t be read through, and only those. Each record carries the version it was stored at, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store drops one stored at another version than the type’s now without reading it, reporting the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event and both versions (","type":"text"},{"code":"DropReport.versionMismatch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). A tracking plan’s check","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(module ","type":"text"},{"code":"TrackingPlans","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") fails on a change that needs a new version while the version stayed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same, naming the event, the property and the change.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"These changes are compatible. Keep the version, and the records stored before the change are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read by each property’s name, in any order:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Version 1, as released.","@Event(name: \"checkout_started\")","struct CheckoutStarted {","    var cartSize: Int","    var screen: String","}","","\/\/ Still version 1: a record stored above reads with coupon nil, currency \"USD\" and screen","\/\/ skipped.","@Event(name: \"checkout_started\")","struct CheckoutStarted {","    var cartSize: Int","    var coupon: String?          \/\/ an optional property added: nil","    var currency: String = \"USD\" \/\/ a property with a default value added: the default","                                 \/\/ screen removed: its stored value is skipped","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"These changes are breaking. Raise the version with each, and the records stored at the earlier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one are dropped and reported:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@Event(name: \"checkout_started\", version: 2)","struct CheckoutStarted {","    var cartSize: Double  \/\/ a property's type changed (it was Int)","    var coupon: String    \/\/ an optional property made required (it was String?)","    var paymentMethod: String \/\/ a required property added, with no default value","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A version raised for a change whose bytes would still read, such as a property that keeps its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type but changes its meaning, drops the earlier records all the same, so they are never read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as the new shape. Records are never migrated from one version to another."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eventmacros\/event(name:consent:version:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://EventMacros/documentation/EventMacros":{"title":"EventMacros","url":"\/documentation\/eventmacros","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Sensitive":{"title":"Sensitive","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/sensitive","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A property value that a destination reads only through the record it arrived in, and not at all","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"once the record is redacted.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Refined":{"title":"Refined","url":"\/documentation\/events\/refined","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Refined","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Refined","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A value that satisfies every constraint of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Rule"},{"type":"text","text":", checked once as it is made, so a property of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this type can’t hold one that doesn’t."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refined"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Event":{"title":"Event","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/event","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Something that happened, recorded as a typed value."}]},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/BinaryCodable":{"title":"BinaryCodable","url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/binarycodable","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BinaryCodable","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BinaryCodable","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A value with a compact binary form, CBOR (RFC 8949), that a store keeps on disk."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/BinaryCodable"},"doc://EventMacros/documentation/EventMacros/Event(name:consent:version:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Makes a struct an event: derives its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryCodable"},{"type":"text","text":" conformances, its name and its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema"},{"type":"text","text":" from its declaration."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros\/Event(name:consent:version:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind"